{
  "_doc": "Shared parity fixture (Phase I-2). Loaded by server/test/pricing_parity_test.dart and mobile/test/pricing_parity_test.dart. Rules: docs/mobile/ARCHITECTURE-I.md §7.1. Values computed by hand from the desktop rules (FinancialUtils.calculateInvoiceTotals, effectiveItemTaxRate, CartController.resolveProductPrice, MultiCurrencyPricelistDao.resolveProductPrice, calculateReturnRefundTotal, SalesReturnRefundSplit).",
  "taxRate": [
